{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31475","headline":"赠方处士兼以写别 · 李羣玉","name":"赠方处士兼以写别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天与云鹤情，人间恣诗酒。\n龙宫奉采觅，澒洞一千首。\n清如南薰丝，韵若黄锺吼。\n喜於风骚地，忽见陶谢手。\n籍籍九江西，篇篇在人口。\n芙蓉爲芳菲，未落诸花後。\n所知心眼大，别自开户牖。\n才力似风鹏，谁能算升斗。\n无营傲云竹，琴帙静爲友。\n鸾凤戢羽仪，骐骥在郊薮。\n镜湖春水绿，越客忆归否。\n白衣四十秋，逍遥一何久。\n此身无定迹，又逐浮云走。\n离思书不穷，残阳落江柳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}